"RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "356622405041141"}]}, "change_log": "We changed:\n\n\nVRC.Mobile.Asset.2\n\nStore cover art images must have a clear logo without extraneous text, taglines, or banners.\n\n\nVRC.Mobile.Input.3\n\nWhen the user presses the back button, the app must either go back one level in your UI or display a menu with an option to quit the app.\nPressing the Back button doesn't go back one level in the menu UI hierarchy, nor does it display a menu with an option to quit the app.\n\nt\nOverview\nResult\nCompatibility Tests\n\nOculus Go\n\n\nThis app includes x86 libraries. These are unnecessary and take up space. The following x86 libraries should be removed: libunity.so, libmonobdwgc-2.0.so, libmain.so, libMonoPosixHelper.so. In the future, this will cause the app to be rejected.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTest\nOverview\nResult\nCorrectness Test\n\nOculus Go\n\n\nThe package does not implement the entitlement check. Please follow the instructions in the Oculus Developer Documentation at https://developer.oculus.com/documentation/platform/latest/concepts/pgsg-unity-gsg/", "created_date": 1559930454, "id": "2282105771868817", "version": "2019.06.07", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2278028978943163", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2342173015862092"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "356622405041141"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1559726325, "id": "2278132132266181", "version": "2019.06.05", "version_code": 1, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"